Description: Graphical Linux system update manager
 UpdateCenter is a graphical front-end for APT on Debian/Ubuntu-based
 distributions. It provides a polished Qt 6 GUI for browsing and installing
 system updates, viewing update history parsed from real APT/dpkg logs, and
 managing third-party repositories with GPG key verification.

